@DeployFoundryCustomerAgent_HostAddress = https://localhost:7041

### 1. Yeni sohbet başlat (conversationId göndermiyoruz)
POST {{DeployFoundryCustomerAgent_HostAddress}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "Kablosuz Kulaklık fiyatı nedir?"
}

###

### 2. Aynı oturumu devam ettir
### Yanıttaki "id" değerini conversationId olarak gönder
POST {{DeployFoundryCustomerAgent_HostAddress}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "biraz önce ne sordum?",
  "conversationId": "29e9f575-36a6-42b3-819a-76727b3ce55d"
}

###

### 3. Sağlık kontrolü
GET {{DeployFoundryCustomerAgent_HostAddress}}/readiness

###


# =============================================================================
# FOUNDRY REST API — HOSTED AGENT DEPLOY
# Kaynak: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/agents/how-to/deploy-hosted-agent
#
# Kullanım:
#   1. Aşağıdaki değişkenleri kendi ortamınıza göre doldurun.
#   2. TOKEN almak için terminalde şunu çalıştırın:
#      az account get-access-token --resource https://ai.azure.com --query accessToken -o tsv
# =============================================================================
@Foundry_Account    = education-test-resource
@Foundry_Project    = education
@Foundry_BaseUrl    = https://{{Foundry_Account}}.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/{{Foundry_Project}}
@Foundry_ApiVersion = v1
@Foundry_Token      = eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsIng1dCI6IndoMDZzRWt6TEhKNXNOTmFVeVJZMl82TzhLMCIsImtpZCI6IndoMDZzRWt6TEhKNXNOTmFVeVJZMl82TzhLMCJ9.__.GSFtbhlF-tQKjQAlP_NeUlHzHob4APh_9YOzHVeHVFYSJbZunU3vl1UvZF3nHuUkH0np0wqnFKb960HhbnTVePAPQkkd1eaI5G6tk35k66ZkTFihBuGBGi4CjOsXj_k5ltP2ExFYnRs2aR5gSUr7uNMqqIH4JSBnv-HvMM2XruX3BxkD7POe10KLWQDc3ZOLFV9dvjBfDVvNkTa47iz7Hyyl6XNoV3RlK73rieAVT-nKjpbt3WGQXLQWW01oueSfkc_QskFgbJio996vOqAp-vcu1-NzL-5gR5BR5ZvPxAJx4dWgCpzFtvpmSOIDee081UtZubu99ZYLj1fiR3hpaQ
@Foundry_AgentName  = simpleAgent1


### 4. [DEPLOY] Agent oluştur (ilk deploy — version 1 oluşturulur)
POST {{Foundry_BaseUrl}}/agents/{{Foundry_AgentName}}/versions?api-version={{Foundry_ApiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Foundry_Token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Foundry-Features: HostedAgents=V1Preview

{
  "definition": {
    "kind": "hosted",
    "container_configuration": {
      "image": "educationfoundry.azurecr.io/simpleagent:v1"
    },
    "cpu": "1",
    "memory": "2Gi",
    "protocol_versions": [
      {
        "protocol": "responses",
        "version": "1.0.0"
      }
    ],
    "environment_variables": {
      "ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT": "Production",
      "ASPNETCORE_HTTP_PORTS": "8088",
      "MODEL_DEPLOYMENT_NAME": "gpt-5-mini"
    }
  }
}

###

### 5. [DEPLOY] Version durumunu sorgula — "active" olana kadar tekrarlayın
### status: provisioning | active | failed | deleted
GET {{Foundry_BaseUrl}}/agents/{{Foundry_AgentName}}/versions/1?api-version={{Foundry_ApiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Foundry_Token}}
Foundry-Features: HostedAgents=V1Preview

###

### 6. [INVOKE] Agent'ı çağır — Responses protokolü (OpenAI uyumlu)
POST {{Foundry_BaseUrl}}/agents/{{Foundry_AgentName}}/endpoint/protocols/openai/responses?api-version={{Foundry_ApiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Foundry_Token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Foundry-Features: HostedAgents=V1Preview

{
  "input": "Kablosuz Kulaklık fiyatı nedir?",
  "store": false
}

###

### 7. [INVOKE] Agent'ı çağır — Invocations protokolü (duplex / streaming)
POST {{Foundry_BaseUrl}}/agents/{{Foundry_AgentName}}/endpoint/protocols/invocations?api-version={{Foundry_ApiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Foundry_Token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Foundry-Features: HostedAgents=V1Preview

{
  "message": "Kablosuz Kulaklık fiyatı nedir?"
}

###

### 8. [UPDATE] Yeni version deploy et (kod/config değişikliği sonrası)
POST {{Foundry_BaseUrl}}/agents/{{Foundry_AgentName}}/versions?api-version={{Foundry_ApiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Foundry_Token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Foundry-Features: HostedAgents=V1Preview

{
  "definition": {
    "kind": "hosted",
    "container_configuration": {
      "image": "educationfoundry.azurecr.io/deployfoundrycustomeragent:v3"
    },
    "cpu": "1",
    "memory": "2Gi",
    "protocol_versions": [
      {
        "protocol": "responses",
        "version": "1.0.0"
      }
    ],
    "environment_variables": {
      "ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT": "Production",
      "ASPNETCORE_HTTP_PORTS": "8088",
      "MODEL_DEPLOYMENT_NAME": "gpt-5-mini"
    }
  }
}

###

### 9. [CLEANUP] Belirli bir version'ı sil
DELETE {{Foundry_BaseUrl}}/agents/{{Foundry_AgentName}}/versions/1?api-version={{Foundry_ApiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Foundry_Token}}
Foundry-Features: HostedAgents=V1Preview

###

### 10. [CLEANUP] Agent'ı tüm version'larıyla birlikte sil
DELETE {{Foundry_BaseUrl}}/agents/{{Foundry_AgentName}}?api-version={{Foundry_ApiVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Foundry_Token}}
Foundry-Features: HostedAgents=V1Preview

###
